.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt SYSTEMD-HWDB 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm systemd-hwdb
.Nd hardware database management tool
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Ss "SYNOPSIS"
.Bd -literal
     systemd-hwdb [options] update

     systemd-hwdb [options] query modalias
.Ed
.Ss "DESCRIPTION"
.Bd -literal
     systemd-hwdb expects a command and command specific arguments. It manages
     the binary hardware database.
.Ed
.Ss "OPTIONS"
.Bd -literal
     --usr
         Generate in /usr/lib/udev instead of /etc/udev.

         Added in version 219.

     -r, --root=PATH
         Alternate root path in the filesystem.

         Added in version 219.

     -s, --strict
         When updating, return non-zero exit value on any parsing error.

         Added in version 239.

     -h, --help
         Print a short help text and exit.

   systemd-hwdb [options] update
     Update the binary database.

   systemd-hwdb [options] query MODALIAS
     Query database and print result.
.Ed
.Ss "SEE ALSO"
.Bd -literal
     systemd(1) hwdb(7)
.Ed
